  "title": "联系表单页(姓名/邮箱/主题/消息 + 前端校验 + 提交反馈)",
  "embedText": "联系表单 留言 咨询 反馈 contact form 邮箱校验 必填项 校验提示 提交按钮 加载状态 成功提示 表单验证",
  "description": "标准的 Contact Us 表单页,包含姓名、邮箱、主题、消息四个字段,前端校验(必填 + 邮箱格式),提交按钮带 loading 状态,成功后显示提示",
  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<section class=\"contact-template\" aria-labelledby=\"contact-title\">\n  <div class=\"contact-template__card\">\n    <h2 id=\"contact-title\">联系我们</h2>\n    <p>请填写下面的信息，我们会在一个工作日内回复。</p>\n    <form class=\"contact-template__form\" novalidate>\n      <label for=\"contact-name\">姓名 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input id=\"contact-name\" name=\"name\" autocomplete=\"name\" required maxlength=\"50\">\n      <label for=\"contact-email\">邮箱 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <input id=\"contact-email\" name=\"email\" type=\"email\" autocomplete=\"email\" required>\n      <label for=\"contact-subject\">主题</label>\n      <input id=\"contact-subject\" name=\"subject\" maxlength=\"80\">\n      <label for=\"contact-message\">消息 <span aria-hidden=\"true\">*</span></label>\n      <textarea id=\"contact-message\" name=\"message\" required rows=\"5\"></textarea>\n      <button type=\"submit\">发送消息</button>\n      <p class=\"contact-template__status\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></p>\n    </form>\n  </div>\n</section>\n<script>\n(() => {\n  const root = document.querySelector('.contact-template');\n  const form = root.querySelector('form');\n  const button = root.querySelector('button');\n  const status = root.querySelector('[role=\"status\"]');\n  form.addEventListener('submit', event => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    if (!form.reportValidity()) return;\n    button.disabled = true;\n    button.textContent = '发送中…';\n    window.setTimeout(() => {\n      form.reset();\n      button.disabled = false;\n      button.textContent = '发送消息';\n      status.textContent = '消息已发送，我们会尽快回复。';\n    }, 600);\n  });\n})();\n</script>\n<style>\n.contact-template { box-sizing: border-box; display: grid; place-items: center; padding: 64px 20px; color: #0f172a; background: #f1f5f9; font-family: system-ui, sans-serif; }\n.contact-template__card { width: min(100%, 560px); padding: clamp(24px, 5vw, 42px); border-radius: 20px; background: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(15, 23, 42, .08); }\n.contact-template h2 { margin: 0; font-size: 2rem; }\n.contact-template__card > p { margin: 10px 0 28px; color: #64748b; line-height: 1.6; }\n.contact-template__form { display: grid; gap: 8px; }\n.contact-template label { margin-top: 10px; color: #334155; font-weight: 700; }\n.contact-template input, .contact-template textarea { box-sizing: border-box; width: 100%; min-height: 44px; padding: 11px 13px; border: 1px solid #cbd5e1; border-radius: 9px; color: #0f172a; background: #ffffff; font: inherit; }\n.contact-template textarea { min-height: 130px; resize: vertical; }\n.contact-template button { min-height: 46px; margin-top: 14px; border: 0; border-radius: 10px; color: #ffffff; background: #4f46e5; font: inherit; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; }\n.contact-template button:disabled { opacity: .65; cursor: wait; }\n.contact-template__status { min-height: 24px; margin: 4px 0 0; color: #166534; }\n.contact-template input:focus-visible, .contact-template textarea:focus-visible, .contact-template button:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #818cf8; outline-offset: 2px; }\n</style>\n"
    }
  ],
  "qualityScore": 0.91
}
